# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit real keys.
# Flash API key from your Definitive account:
# API Keys -> Create a new key -> Access Type = Flash -> Generate New Key
# The key alone (dpka_…) can only request quotes — it cannot move funds.
# Live mode is quote-only in this build: submission needs a funder wallet,
# which is intentionally not wired here.
FLASH_API_KEY=<redacted>

# Paper mode (the default) needs nothing at all.
